hardware/ESP32-3248S035-3-5INCH-LCD-main/1-Demo/
hardware/ESP32-3248S035-3-5INCH-LCD-main/6-User_Manual/
hardware/ESP32-3248S035-3-5INCH-LCD-main/7-Character&Picture_Molding_Tool/
hardware/ESP32-3248S035-3-5INCH-LCD-main/8-Burn operation/
hardware/ESP32-3248S035-3-5INCH-LCD-main/PICTURES/
